## 🚀 Quick Start

1. Download the GTA VI Launcher companion package.
2. Extract the downloaded archive to a folder on your Windows desktop.
3. Run the executable as Administrator to open the launcher interface.

The main interface opens with official game links, platform information, and installation references.

## 💻 Requirements

| Component | Requirement |
|---|---|
| OS | Windows 10 / 11, 64-bit |
| RAM | 4 GB minimum |
| Storage | 500 MB for the companion |
| Privileges | Administrator |

**Game platform information:** Grand Theft Auto VI is available for PlayStation 5 and Xbox Series X|S. Rockstar has not listed a Windows PC version. This Windows companion provides game information and official links rather than installing or launching the console game.

