## 📖 Launcher Setup

### 1. Open the Official Game Page
Visit the Rockstar GTA VI website to access official announcements, screenshots, trailers, and platform information.

### 2. Choose Your Platform
Select PlayStation 5 or Xbox Series X|S. These are the officially listed platforms for GTA VI.

### 3. Select Your Edition
Review Standard and Ultimate Edition details before purchasing. Standard Edition owners can also purchase the Ultimate Edition Upgrade separately.

### 4. Open the Correct Store
Use the PlayStation Store for PS5 or Microsoft Store for Xbox. Make sure the selected version matches your console.

### 5. Install the Game
Download GTA VI through your console's official game library or storefront.

### 6. Complete Activation
Redeem digital game codes through the appropriate platform account. Check regional restrictions before redeeming a code.

### 7. Start Playing
After the download and required updates finish, launch GTA VI from your console library.

