## ❓ FAQ

**Do I need to run it as Administrator?**

Yes — admin rights are required for the overlay to attach.

**Why does Windows display an antivirus warning?**

Review the file source and scan downloaded files with your preferred security software before opening them.

**Does the launcher companion work on Windows 11?**

The desktop companion is structured for Windows 10 and Windows 11, 64-bit systems.

**Can I launch GTA VI directly from a Windows PC?**

Rockstar currently lists PlayStation 5 and Xbox Series X|S as supported platforms. A Windows PC version is not listed.

**How do I keep the launcher information updated?**

Check Rockstar's official website and support pages for current game, platform, and installation information.

